8-6351\">0000-0001-6288-6351</a></p><p>U-1700-035E-7078</p><p>e-mail: adriana.munteanu@ivb.ro;</p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/CV-Bostan-Marinela.pdf\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/m.bostan-150x150.png\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/CV-Bostan-Marinela.pdf\">Marinela Bostan </a></h3>\n<p>Cercetător Ştiinţific I (CS I)</p><p>PhD</p><p><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3050-6486\">0000-0003-3050-6486</a></p><p>U-1700-034R-3521</p><p>e-mail: marinela.bostan@ivb.ro</p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/EG-Dobre_CV_RO.pdf\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/e.dobre_-150x150.png\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/EG-Dobre_CV_RO.pdf\">Elena Georgiana Dobre</a></h3>\n<p>Asistent cercetare (ACS)</p><p>PhD</p><p><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6464-381X\">0000-0002-6464-381X</a></p><p>U-2000-066K-5644</p><p>e-mail: georgiana.dobre@ivb.ro</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/m.burghelea-150x150.png\" width=\"150\"/></figure><h3>Mariana Burghelea </h3><p>Tehnician Laborator</p>\n<p>U-1700-038P-8017</p>",
